# CtrlIRL-Coder pipeline template — full contract (MPEG-TS).
#
# The pipeline encodes video (H.264) + audio (AAC) and muxes them to MPEG-TS.
# It ends in the terminal `appsink name=appsink` — the exact contract of the
# original ctrlirl_coder/belacoder. ctrlirl-coder pulls it with
# gst_app_sink_pull_sample (Go, internal/gstpull) and sends the TS bytes over
# SRT itself (the Go-owned SRT socket — see internal/srt). There is NO
# in-pipeline SRT sink; the destination comes from config.toml [srt] uri.
#
# The appsink is also the stats surface for the adaptive bitrate controller:
# pulled-frame liveness (stall detection), encoded throughput, caps framerate.
# Backpressure: drop=true (forced by the contract check) — a stalled SRT send
# path makes the sink drop buffers, never wedges the pipeline.
#
# Contract elements present:
#   appsink   — terminal sink the pipeline ends in (MANDATORY; Go pulls +
#               sends SRT; appsink stats feed the adaptive balancer)
#   venc_kbps — x264enc, `bitrate` property in kbit/s (NAME is the contract)
#   overlay   — textoverlay for live stats
#   mux       — mpegtsmux (TS multiplex of video + audio)
#
# h264parse with config-interval=1 pushes SPS/PPS at the start / every keyframe
# so a TS receiver connecting mid-stream (OBS) can decode immediately.
#
# To stream, point [srt] uri in config.toml at a running SRT listener, e.g. an
# OBS SRT Input source on srt://127.0.0.1:7000, or a local capture for a smoke
# test:
#   gst-launch-1.0 srtsrc uri=srt://:9101 mode=listener ! fakesink

videotestsrc is-live=true pattern=smpte
  ! video/x-raw,width=1920,height=1080,framerate=30/1
  ! videoconvert
  ! textoverlay text="init" valignment=top halignment=right font-desc="Monospace 24" name=overlay
  ! queue
  ! videoconvert
  ! video/x-raw,format=I420
  ! x264enc speed-preset=superfast tune=zerolatency bitrate=6000 key-int-max=30 name=venc_kbps
  ! h264parse config-interval=1
  ! mux.
audiotestsrc is-live=true wave=sine freq=440
  ! audio/x-raw,rate=48000,channels=2
  ! audioconvert
  ! voaacenc bitrate=128000
  ! aacparse
  ! mux.
mpegtsmux name=mux
  ! appsink name=appsink
